OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fbrighter breaks and isolated showers
OL,7,Fthrough this evening, with further
OL,8,Fclear spells overnight with a very low
OL,9,Frisk of some isolated showers. Winds
OL,10,Feasing somewhat but remaining breezy
OL,11,Faround coasts. Mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA mix of bright spells and a
OL,14,Ffew showers is expected on Monday
OL,15,Fmorning. The afternoon looks mostly
OL,16,Fdry, though cloudy at times, with
OL,17,Flight rain possible later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
