OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FThe
OL,6,Fweather looks rather changeable. There
OL,7,Fwill be some warm sunshine at times.
OL,8,FHowever, showers are also likely,
OL,9,Fespecially in the north, and it will
OL,10,Fbe breezy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
